      "username": "Powerhound_2000",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-22T13:29:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When I finally did the Redirection acheivement some time ago I believe I setup the following. &nbsp; Blade Battalion hit Tachyon who was highest redirected by Synaptic Interruption to the lowest health hero, which got redirected by Wraith’s smoke bombs, which got redirected to Scholar with Alchemial Redirection, which got redirected to Legacy with Lead from the Front, and finally sent to Stealth Bot. &nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:45:57.824Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
