      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>When I finally did the Redirection acheivement some time ago I believe I setup the following. &nbsp; Blade Battalion hit Tachyon who was highest redirected by Synaptic Interruption to the lowest health hero, which got redirected by Wraith&rsquo;s smoke bombs, which got redirected to Scholar with Alchemial Redirection, which got redirected to Legacy with Lead from the Front, and finally sent to Stealth Bot. &nbsp;</p>",
