      "id": 214699,
      "name": "broccoli",
      "username": "broccoli",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-02-22T14:22:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, your best bets definitely revolve around Lead from the Front, Synaptic Interruption, Stealth Bot, and Smoke Bombs.&nbsp; I think in mine I managed to redirect to Tachyon twice using 2 different Synaptic Interruptions.&nbsp; Argent Adept helps as well, since with Scherzo of Frost and Flame, you can adjust people's hps to be exactly where you need them.&nbsp; In particular, if everyone is at the same hp, they're all the highest and lowest for smoke bombs.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:45:57.890Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
