      "cooked": "<p>I believe I got the redirects by taking Legacy, Wraith, the Scholar, the Naturalist, and Fanatic out to play, Legacy, Naturalist, and Scholar got their respective \"redirect to me\"s out, Wraith played Smoke Bombs, and Fanatic shot herself in the face a bunch and then hit someone to redirect all their damage to her. Then someone attacked Legacy, which redirected to Fanatic, which redirected through Smoke Bombs to the Scholar, which redirected to Legacy, which redirected to the Naturalist, which redirected back to the Scholar.</p><p>(Also good choice - Unity. Keep the Stealth Bot out as the only bot, and use smoke bombs, and you've got two redirects to start.)</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
